Doc: * Hybrid retriever combining KNN vector search and BM25 keyword search
 * via Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF).
 *
 * <p>Both searches run in parallel. Results are merged and re-ranked using RRF (k=60).
 * This typically yields +100–150% retrieval quality over KNN-only, based on benchmark results.
Field: private static final int KNN_TOP_K = 5;
Field: private static final int BM25_TOP_K = 5;
Field: private static final int FINAL_TOP_K = 3;
Field: private static final long SEARCH_TIMEOUT_SECONDS = 5;
Field: private final LuceneEmbeddingStore<TextSegment> store;
Field: private final EmbeddingModel embeddingModel;
