Method: fr.baretto.ollamassist.prerequiste.PrerequisiteService#readAuthenticated
Doc: * Builds a platform HTTP request to the Ollama endpoint, attaching the configured
     * {@code Authorization} header (Basic or Bearer) when authentication is enabled.
     * Required so that prerequisite checks succeed when Ollama sits behind an authenticated
     * proxy (e.g. OpenWebUI).
Signature: private static String readAuthenticated(String url) throws IOException
Body: {
    String authHeaderValue = AuthenticationHelper.createAuthorizationHeaderValue();
    return HttpRequests.request(url).connectTimeout(3000).readTimeout(3000).tuner(connection -> {
        if (authHeaderValue != null) {
            connection.setRequestProperty(AuthenticationHelper.AUTHORIZATION_HEADER, authHeaderValue);
        }
    }).readString();
}

