Method: fr.baretto.ollamassist.utils.FontUtils#getIDECodeFont
Doc: * Get IDE code font with multiplier applied.
Signature: private static Font getIDECodeFont()
Body: {
    Font editorFont = UIUtil.getLabelFont();
    try {
        // Try to get font from scheme if available
        editorFont = UIUtil.getLabelFont();
    } catch (Exception e) {
        // Fall back to label font
    }
    // Code font typically slightly smaller
    return deriveWithRelativeSize(editorFont, 0.9f);
}

---
Method: fr.baretto.ollamassist.setting.OllamAssistUISettings#setFontSizeMultiplier
Signature: public void setFontSizeMultiplier(float multiplier)
Body: {
    myState.fontSizeMultiplier = Math.max(0.5f, Math.min(2.0f, multiplier));
}

---
Method: fr.baretto.ollamassist.utils.FontUtils#updateMultiplier
Doc: * Update the multiplier from settings. Should be called when settings change.
Signature: public static void updateMultiplier()
Body: {
    OllamAssistUISettings settings = OllamAssistUISettings.getInstance();
    if (settings != null && settings.getState() != null) {
        currentMultiplier = Math.max(0.5f, Math.min(2.0f, settings.getState().fontSizeMultiplier));
    } else {
        currentMultiplier = 1.0f;
    }
    clearCache();
}

